^\.git/                 Git repository
^\.gitattributes$       Git archive exclude rules
^\.gitignore$           Git exclude rules
^\.mailmap$             Git mailmap
^LICENSE$               License fulltext
^Makefile$              Makefile.PL artifact
^Makefile\.old$         ditto
^MANIFEST\.bak$         ditto
^MANIFEST\.SKIP$        This MANIFEST exclude ruleset
^MYMETA\.json$          Makefile.PL artifact
^MYMETA\.yml$           Makefile.PL artifact
^Sort-Search-           This distribution
^bench/                 Benchmark?
^blib/                  Build lib
^xlib/                  Experimental code (think "contrib"?)
^cpanfile$              CPAN dependencies
^pm_to_blib$            Makefile.PL artifact
^src/                   Extra
^xt/                    Experimental tests (author tests?)
